        "current files: engine/src/plugins/render/gpu_primitives/scan.rs, plan.rs, counters.rs, compaction.rs, and draw_args.rs",
        "current shaders: gpu_primitive_counter_reset.wgsl, gpu_primitive_prefix_scan.wgsl, gpu_primitive_prefix_scan_apply_offsets.wgsl, gpu_primitive_u32_scatter.wgsl, gpu_primitive_indirect_draw_args.wgsl, and gpu_primitive_indexed_indirect_draw_args.wgsl",
